# The evidence tree ships as a *shape*, not as content.
#
# The twenty scenario directories and the two schemas are in git so a fresh
# clone has somewhere for evidence to land and something to validate it
# against. Everything a run produces — results, ledgers, copied logs, journals,
# snapshots, screenshots — is generated on the machine that has the game, and is
# committed deliberately, if at all, rather than by default.
#
# The order matters. `*` ignores everything, `!*/` lets git descend into
# directories again (an ignored directory cannot have its contents re-included),
# and the rules after that name what stays.

*
!*/

!.gitignore
!README.md
!schema/*.json
!**/.gitkeep
